      "dom_id": "step-q185352",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "The solution to the equation $x+4=16$ is $x=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "If we substitute $x=12$ into the given equation, we get a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+4 & =16 \\\\ 12+4 & =16 \\\\ 16 & =16\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=12.$",
