      "problem": "If $x+6=5,$ then $x=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "If we substitute $x=-1$ into the given equation, we get a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+6 & =5 \\\\ (-1)+6 & =5 \\\\ -1+6 & =5 \\\\ 5 & =5\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=-1.$",
