      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "If $-8n=64,$ then $n=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "If we substitute $n=-8$ into the given equation, we get a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-8n & =64 \\\\ -8\\cdot (-8) & =64 \\\\ 64 & =64\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $n=-8.$",
