      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "If $\\frac{56}{x}=7,$ then $x=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "If we substitute $x=8$ into the given equation, we get a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{56}{x} & =7 \\\\ \\frac{56}{8} & =7 \\\\ 7 & =7\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x=8.$",
